# Pin line endings. The five results CSVs originally carried CRLF, which
# git normalised on checkout; that changed their bytes and made five
# SHA256SUMS entries fail. Every text file is now stored and checked out
# with LF, so the committed bytes are the hashed bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.gz   binary
*.pyc  binary
